======================================================================
  Architecture Diagram: Phase 110 - Correlation IDs
======================================================================

1. Simplest Baseline Architecture:
----------------------------------------------------------------------
   Independent log files with unlinked log entries across 4 services.

   [Client] ──▶ [Application Server] ──▶ [Primary Datastore]


2. Scaled / Resilient Architecture:
----------------------------------------------------------------------
   Correlation ID generated at gateway, propagated via HTTP headers and message payloads.

                               ┌──▶ [Worker Node A] ──┬──▶ [Cache]
[Client] ──▶ [Load Balancer] ──┼──▶ [Worker Node B] ──┤
                               └──▶ [Worker Node C] ──┴──▶ [Primary DB] ──▶ [Replicas]
                                         │
                                         ▼
                                   [Event Queue] ──▶ [Async Workers]

======================================================================
